<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-16T04:46:42.138Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 04:46:42 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen killed a traditional ruler in Plateau while soldiers were feared killed in a Boko Haram attack on a military post in Borno. Bandits abducted a couple and their six-month-old daughter in Kaduna and later released them after a N300 million ransom demand. Islamist fighters, including Boko Haram and ISWAP, struck a Borno army base, causing soldier casualties. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxPcFZtNFNEN2JfMWRJaVE3RTFYY21mdlFtYmNSM2pWRkdpRU5COVZ0Q2lFT3ZHUXRQd2tYU2o2b0VYMjFiRXBtZWhiU2cyZThLQ0kzVW1DNHFoNWlLNkZFMEs1TzVaQ1hfLUFJMENBa3VvVmxDTzZxSFA2QmhSV24weVZYWDhSQnc1Tmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxOcVF3RUtRN2k0NG40WkFWUUQ1eFFuWEJZenZzM0lLWFRNNFNZWHZEdGg4MTZfQV9DZUtwSjQ1dE9LSzE2SjQ3V3F4RkdqQUpleHNtRGM1S216ZW9HYnJxSDJuUnJWRFF6SHliQWRqM0t0eTZaRVMwdzVsaG5RTzZuLVg1Q0l4a2FxN1FRUEVvUlJOeVFZS3JreGl1Z1hBZ1BxbjJCc3p6VnZSZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPcktkUEVkeGhlX1pWbEU1R1RrWDRIaGUzOWJLS21iLXdQc3AxUTV5RkhvaUtsLXJyY0MzYWtpOGpNWFVHdC12ME5SemNGUFRrcGNHTFFydUZtYW50Mm96cDR4WFVSRHpPbWRXX1I4TWsycmRZU2RDTGs2S25saEJRSnZqWV9DTlJ3a0dV?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQdmdWWnl6Z1VBRklKQkJ4bTFSVFhJYkhBNGViMUdWVEFnQTdKSWUwYXZ1Qkl3eXNGTUdydHhBcUNhc3VDZU1NODAwNmwtMVkyN1N2U1pVNVM3TzF3WFJBX0hXdU1lUUdSVnVLbm9OcWk3VmZFN1lDdnNTS2xXR25IZDJpWlM0OWR1OEVQa0RrMzFXYldLUFVGQUZ2ZkFsRG5O?oc=5&quot;&gt;RELEVANT Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxPNmU5QVA3Z1R4QWZUMUN5OEhwNzF0dl94UXFDeUk5OGRqRkpSRHdxX25ON1lJaFdRVVVPSGNqNmt